        <item>
            <title><![CDATA[本地文件夹与github远程仓库建立联系]]></title>
            <link>https://waiwaitTong.github.io/blog/git笔记</link>
            <guid>https://waiwaitTong.github.io/blog/git笔记</guid>
            <pubDate>Sun, 15 Mar 2026 12:21:27 GMT</pubDate>
            <description><![CDATA[- 初始化]]></description>
            <content:encoded><![CDATA[<ul>
<li class="">初始化</li>
</ul>
<p>注意新建远程仓库不要勾选创建readme文件</p>
<div class="language-text codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_QJqH"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-text codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">git init  #本地vscode建立初始仓库</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">git add . #暂存文件</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">git commit -m "init" #建立一版版本快照</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">git branch -M main #将该分支命名为main</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">git remote add origin 仓库地址 #设置绑定远程仓库</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">git push -u origin main      # 上传代码并建立跟踪关系</span><br></span></code></pre></div></div>
<ul>
<li class="">
<p>日常操作</p>
<div class="language-text codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_QJqH"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-text codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">git pull #拉取当前最新仓库</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">git add . #暂存修改</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">git commit -m "update" #保存一版</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">git push #提交到远程仓库</span><br></span></code></pre></div></div>
</li>
</ul>
<h1>一些常用命令</h1>
<ul>
<li class="">
<p>将文件添加到暂存区</p>
<div class="language-text codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_QJqH"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-text codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">git add .</span><br></span></code></pre></div></div>
</li>
<li class="">
<p>将暂存区文件添加到当前分支</p>
<div class="language-text codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_QJqH"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-text codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">git commit -m"message"</span><br></span></code></pre></div></div>
</li>
<li class="">
<p>查看日志</p>
<div class="language-text codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_QJqH"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-text codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">git reflog</span><br></span></code></pre></div></div>
</li>
<li class="">
<p>回到某个状态</p>
<div class="language-text codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_QJqH"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-text codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">git reset --hard &lt;哈希值&gt;</span><br></span></code></pre></div></div>
</li>
<li class="">
<p>修改上一次注释</p>
<div class="language-text codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_QJqH"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-text codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">git commit --amend -m"message"</span><br></span></code></pre></div></div>
</li>
</ul>]]></content:encoded>
        </item>
        <item>
            <title><![CDATA[个人网站搭建]]></title>
            <link>https://waiwaitTong.github.io/blog/2025/10/31/个人网站搭建</link>
            <guid>https://waiwaitTong.github.io/blog/2025/10/31/个人网站搭建</guid>
            <pubDate>Fri, 31 Oct 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
            <description><![CDATA[经学长建议决定搭一个个人网站 以记录自己各种  可以避免出现想发表重要意见 但没有具体的发表对象 又不乐意发朋友圈的情况]]></description>
            <content:encoded><![CDATA[<div class="language-text codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_QJqH"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-text codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">---</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">title: "个人网站搭建"</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">authors: 歪歪踢</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">tags: [blog]</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">date: 2025-10-31</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">---</span><br></span></code></pre></div></div>
<h1>动机</h1>
<p>经学长建议决定搭一个个人网站 以记录自己各种  可以避免出现想发表重要意见 但没有具体的发表对象 又不乐意发朋友圈的情况</p>
<h1>收获</h1>
<ol>
<li class="">
<p>Markdown使用</p>
</li>
<li class="">
<p>AI辅助与认清AI</p>
</li>
</ol>
<h1>步骤</h1>
<h3 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Vzrq" id="环境准备">环境准备<a href="https://waiwaittong.github.io/blog/2025/10/31/%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E7%BD%91%E7%AB%99%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA#%E7%8E%AF%E5%A2%83%E5%87%86%E5%A4%87" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to 环境准备" title="Direct link to 环境准备" translate="no">​</a></h3>
<ol>
<li class="">
<p>生成 SSH 密钥：<code>ssh-keygen -t rsa -C "your_email@example.com"</code></p>
</li>
<li class="">
<p>将公钥添加到 GitHub：<code>cat ~/.ssh/id_rsa.pub</code></p>
</li>
<li class="">
<p>配置 SSH 使用 443 端口</p>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Vzrq" id="项目部署">项目部署<a href="https://waiwaittong.github.io/blog/2025/10/31/%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E7%BD%91%E7%AB%99%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA#%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to 项目部署" title="Direct link to 项目部署" translate="no">​</a></h3>
<p>建议自行前往 <a href="https://www.docusaurus.cn/docs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">https://www.docusaurus.cn/docs</a> 官方文档查阅学习</p>
<h1>部署完成工作流程</h1>
<p>在dev分支中</p>
<ol>
<li class="">vscode中保存，提交文件</li>
<li class="">终端中yarn bulid构建文件</li>
<li class="">终端中yarn deploy部署</li>
</ol>
<h1>问题及解决方案</h1>
<h2 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Vzrq" id="环境配置问题">环境配置问题<a href="https://waiwaittong.github.io/blog/2025/10/31/%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E7%BD%91%E7%AB%99%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA#%E7%8E%AF%E5%A2%83%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to 环境配置问题" title="Direct link to 环境配置问题" translate="no">​</a></h2>
<p>cmd检测版本号成功 powershell不成功 </p>
<p>尝试重装后 开开关关cmd和powershell  再检测又成功</p>
<p>deepseek解释说下载前打开终端导致</p>
<p>那以后多开开关关终端好了</p>
<h2 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Vzrq" id="权限问题">权限问题<a href="https://waiwaittong.github.io/blog/2025/10/31/%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E7%BD%91%E7%AB%99%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA#%E6%9D%83%E9%99%90%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to 权限问题" title="Direct link to 权限问题" translate="no">​</a></h2>
<p>管理员权限运行即可</p>
<p>或一劳永逸：将code文件夹属性安全改为完全控制</p>
<h2 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Vzrq" id="网页不刷新">网页不刷新<a href="https://waiwaittong.github.io/blog/2025/10/31/%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E7%BD%91%E7%AB%99%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA#%E7%BD%91%E9%A1%B5%E4%B8%8D%E5%88%B7%E6%96%B0" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to 网页不刷新" title="Direct link to 网页不刷新" translate="no">​</a></h2>
<p>并非不刷新</p>
<p>只是新手初始化教程中选择的页面问题 </p>
<h2 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Vzrq" id="网页崩溃">网页崩溃<a href="https://waiwaittong.github.io/blog/2025/10/31/%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E7%BD%91%E7%AB%99%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA#%E7%BD%91%E9%A1%B5%E5%B4%A9%E6%BA%83" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to 网页崩溃" title="Direct link to 网页崩溃" translate="no">​</a></h2>
<p>不知道啥情况 直接重启网站好了</p>
<h2 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Vzrq" id="编辑后打开巨卡无比">编辑后打开巨卡无比<a href="https://waiwaittong.github.io/blog/2025/10/31/%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E7%BD%91%E7%AB%99%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA#%E7%BC%96%E8%BE%91%E5%90%8E%E6%89%93%E5%BC%80%E5%B7%A8%E5%8D%A1%E6%97%A0%E6%AF%94" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to 编辑后打开巨卡无比" title="Direct link to 编辑后打开巨卡无比" translate="no">​</a></h2>
<p> npm run build重启</p>
<h2 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Vzrq" id="github-pages-部署问题总结">GitHub Pages 部署问题总结<a href="https://waiwaittong.github.io/blog/2025/10/31/%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E7%BD%91%E7%AB%99%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA#github-pages-%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%93" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to GitHub Pages 部署问题总结" title="Direct link to GitHub Pages 部署问题总结" translate="no">​</a></h2>
<h3 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Vzrq" id="以为成功后网站简陋且丢失blog页面">以为成功后网站简陋且丢失blog页面<a href="https://waiwaittong.github.io/blog/2025/10/31/%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E7%BD%91%E7%AB%99%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA#%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%BA%E6%88%90%E5%8A%9F%E5%90%8E%E7%BD%91%E7%AB%99%E7%AE%80%E9%99%8B%E4%B8%94%E4%B8%A2%E5%A4%B1blog%E9%A1%B5%E9%9D%A2" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to 以为成功后网站简陋且丢失blog页面" title="Direct link to 以为成功后网站简陋且丢失blog页面" translate="no">​</a></h3>
<p>似乎是github强制使用自己的网站部署</p>
<p>使用deepseek和csdn推送的教程均不顶用</p>
<p>于是选择一切初始化 重新连接仓库开始</p>
<p><a href="https://www.docusaurus.io/docs/deployment#deploying-to-github-pages%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9E%E4%B8%8A%E6%9C%89%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%96%87%E6%A1%A3" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">https://www.docusaurus.io/docs/deployment#deploying-to-github-pages事实上有官方文档</a></p>
<p>可读性不强</p>
<p>让AI总结了一份</p>
<h3 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Vzrq" id="ssh-密钥生成与配置问题">SSH 密钥生成与配置问题<a href="https://waiwaittong.github.io/blog/2025/10/31/%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E7%BD%91%E7%AB%99%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA#ssh-%E5%AF%86%E9%92%A5%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90%E4%B8%8E%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to SSH 密钥生成与配置问题" title="Direct link to SSH 密钥生成与配置问题" translate="no">​</a></h3>
<div class="language-c codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_QJqH"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-c codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">ssh</span><span class="token operator" style="color:#393A34">:</span><span class="token plain"> connect to host github</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">.</span><span class="token plain">com port </span><span class="token number" style="color:#36acaa">22</span><span class="token operator" style="color:#393A34">:</span><span class="token plain"> Connection refused</span><br></span></code></pre></div></div>
<div class="language-markdown codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_QJqH"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-markdown codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token title important punctuation" style="color:#393A34">#</span><span class="token title important"> 使用 443 端口测试连接</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">ssh -T -p 443 git@ssh.github.com</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain" style="display:inline-block"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain"></span><span class="token title important punctuation" style="color:#393A34">#</span><span class="token title important"> 创建 SSH 配置文件</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">mkdir -p </span><span class="token strike punctuation" style="color:#393A34">~</span><span class="token strike content">/.ssh</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token strike content">cat &gt; </span><span class="token strike punctuation" style="color:#393A34">~</span><span class="token plain">/.ssh/config &lt;&lt; 'EOF'</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">Host github.com</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">    Hostname ssh.github.com</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">    Port 443</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">    User git</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">EOF</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain" style="display:inline-block"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain"></span><span class="token title important punctuation" style="color:#393A34">#</span><span class="token title important"> 设置文件权限</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">chmod 600 ~/.ssh/config</span><br></span></code></pre></div></div>
<h1>遗留问题</h1>
<ol>
<li class="">
<p>docker学习使用</p>
</li>
<li class="">
<p>英文阅读</p>
</li>
<li class="">
<p>（已完成）新手如何利用ai快速入门 且判别ai正确性（见AI反思）</p>
</li>
</ol>]]></content:encoded>
